#
# Accepted CVEs for the Trivy image gate (.github/workflows/images.yml).
# Only CVEs that are (a) bundled in a third-party base/runtime we cannot patch without a major
# upgrade AND (b) not reachable with attacker-controlled input in our deployment belong here.
# Each entry must carry a justification and an expiry so it is revisited.

# --- Apache Spark 3.5.0 bundled JARs (services/spark_jobs/*) ---
# These live in the Spark distribution's jars/ dir, not our code. Remediation is a Spark
# version upgrade, tracked as its own task (docs/operations/production-readiness.md). In our
# pipeline the Spark jobs consume only first-party Kafka data (no attacker-supplied Avro
# schemas), ZooKeeper is internal-only, and Derby is unused — so these are not reachable.
CVE-2024-47561 exp:2026-09-30  # org.apache.avro:avro 1.7.7/1.11.2 — schema-parse RCE (Spark-bundled)
CVE-2022-46337 exp:2026-09-30  # org.apache.derby:derby 10.14.2.0 — LDAP injection (Spark-bundled, Derby unused)
CVE-2023-44981 exp:2026-09-30  # org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper 3.6.3 — authz bypass (Spark-bundled, ZK internal)
